  "releaseNotes": "## New Apps\n* Bump `net_conduit_tcp` from `1.2.2` to `1.2.3`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_tcp/1.2.2...net_conduit_tcp/1.2.3)\n* Bump `net_conduit_websocket` from `1.2.2` to `1.2.3`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_websocket/1.2.2...net_conduit_websocket/1.2.3)\n* Bump `net_conduit_udp` from `1.2.2` to `1.2.3`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_udp/1.2.2...net_conduit_udp/1.2.3)\n* Bump `net_conduit_ipc` from `1.2.2` to `1.2.3`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_ipc/1.2.2...net_conduit_ipc/1.2.3)\n* Bump `net_conduit_quic` from `1.2.2` to `1.2.3`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_quic/1.2.2...net_conduit_quic/1.2.3)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20251206023921.7070ad7...build.20251206034857.affbbed",
